EY first round interview questions I asked recently 🚀🔥
Preparing for a DevOps role? Here’s a solid set of real-world questions to test yourself 👇
🔹 #Linux 🐧
• How do you create and manage users/groups in Linux?
 • Explain file permissions (chmod) and ownership (chown).
 • What is umask and how does it impact default permissions?
 • How do you troubleshoot high CPU, memory, or disk usage?
 • Write a Bash script to alert when disk usage exceeds a threshold.
 • Difference between cron jobs and systemd timers.
🔹 #Git 🔧
• Difference between Fetch vs Pull vs Merge vs Rebase.
 • Git Reset vs Git Revert — when to use each?
 • How do you handle merge conflicts in a team environment?
 • What branching strategy have you used (GitFlow / trunk-based)?
 • How do you safely roll back a bad production commit?
🔹 #Docker 🐳
• Explain Docker architecture (Client, Daemon, Registry).
 • Image vs Container vs Volume — key differences.
 • What are Multi-stage builds and why use them?
 • How do you reduce Docker image size?
 • Explain Docker networking basics.
 • Container keeps restarting — how do you debug it?
🔹 #Kubernetes ☸️
• Explain Kubernetes architecture (Control Plane + Nodes).
 • Deployment vs StatefulSet vs DaemonSet vs Job.
 • Services vs Ingress — how traffic flows?
 • Troubleshooting CrashLoopBackOff — step-by-step approach.
 • Requests vs Limits — why they matter?
 • ConfigMaps vs Secrets — use cases.
 • Liveness vs Readiness probes.
 • Node Affinity, Taints & Tolerations — when to use?
 • How do you upgrade an EKS cluster with minimal downtime?
 • HPA vs Cluster Autoscaler.
🔹 #Jenkins #CICD ⚙️
• Explain your CI/CD pipeline design.
 • Declarative vs Scripted pipelines.
 • How do you implement CI/CD for microservices?
 • How do you secure Jenkins pipelines?
 • Pipeline suddenly fails — how do you debug?
🔹 #AWS ☁️
• Explain VPC architecture (subnets, routing, gateways).
 • Security Groups vs NACLs.
 • IAM Roles vs Policies.
 • EC2 vs Auto Scaling vs Load Balancer.
 • EBS vs EFS vs S3 — when to use what?
 • How do private instances access the internet (NAT Gateway)?
 • Which AWS services have you used in real projects?
🔹 #Terraform 🏗️
• Explain Terraform workflow (init, plan, apply).
 • What is Terraform State and why is it critical?
 • Remote backend — why and how?
 • State locking — how it prevents conflicts?
 • What is Terraform drift?
 • Resource vs Data source.
 • How do you manage secrets securely?
🔹 #ScenarioBased 🧠
• Pod stuck in CrashLoopBackOff — what’s your approach?
 • CI/CD pipeline failing after recent changes — how do you debug?
 • Terraform apply failed midway — recovery steps?
 • Application not accessible after deployment — checklist?
 • CPU suddenly spikes to 100% — investigation steps?
 • One Availability Zone goes down — how does your system handle it?
